        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 103/10304, Traditional Privacy Lock with Thumbturn on Either Side</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's 103/10304 Double Thumbturn Traditional Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with 2-3/8 inch backsets.  Spindles will need to be trimmed to fit thinner doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Double Thumbturn:</b> Locks and unlocks via the turnpiece on either side of the door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia Double Thumbturn Privacy Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter (both interior and exterior): 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Height: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt: 9/16\" throw solid brass bolt</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" \"</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, (2) rosettes, and (2) turnpieces.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-OMNDoubleTT-Privacy-Bolt-Installation.pdf?v=1774580759\" target=\"new\"><b>Double Thumbturn Privacy Bolt Installation Template (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Will not cover a 2-1/8\" pre-drilled door borehole.</i>\r\n</p>",
