                "description": "Omnia's 103/10304 Double Thumbturn Traditional Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. For doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch backsets.",
